{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"algorithmic accountability algorithmic accountability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md","fileName":"Algorithmic Accountability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Algorithmic Accountability","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Responsibility and Explainability]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","AI Transparency","Algorithmic Auditability","Responsibility Gap","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"algorithmic accountability algorithmic accountability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md","fileName":"Algorithmic Accountability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Algorithmic Accountability","heading":"Algorithmic Accountability","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Algorithmic accountability is the requirement that people and organizations using automated systems remain answerable for their design choices, decisions, and consequences. It includes identifying who can authorize use, who monitors performance, who explains an outcome, and who can provide correction or remedy.\n\nAccountability is broader than [[AI Transparency]]. Information must reach an actor with both a duty to respond and the power to change the system. Clear roles, [[Algorithmic Auditability]], complaint procedures, and enforceable rules prevent distributed development from becoming a [[Responsibility Gap]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","AI Transparency","Algorithmic Auditability","Responsibility Gap","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"algorithmic accountability algorithmic accountability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Algorithmic Accountability.md","fileName":"Algorithmic Accountability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Algorithmic Accountability","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","AI Transparency","Algorithmic Auditability","Responsibility Gap","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}